# Tests

This project includes a small host-side test suite that validates the packet serializer and a basic transport-style round-trip flow without requiring hardware.

## Test categories
- Unit tests: serializer round-trip and CRC rejection in [test/test_serializer/test_serializer.cpp](test/test_serializer/test_serializer.cpp)
- Integration tests: packet serialization/parsing through a fake transport in [test/integration/test_transport.cpp](test/integration/test_transport.cpp)
- System smoke test: [test/run_tests.sh](test/run_tests.sh)

## Run the tests
From the project root:

```bash
./test/run_tests.sh
```

The script compiles and runs both test binaries with the host C++ toolchain.

More information about PlatformIO Unit Testing:
- https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
